The webmail image now runs PHP 8.4 instead of PHP 8.3. Roundcube spellchecks through `enchant` rather than `pspell`, which PHP 8.4 moved out of its core distribution -- if you override `spellcheck_engine` back to `pspell`, switch it to `enchant`. The snuffleupagus build in `core/base` no longer depends on which PHP alpine treats as its default, which is what blocked the move to alpine 3.23.
